			<div class="content" id="post-content-1228184">
									

<p>from the contest thread:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I made a entry: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-1000drgears">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-1000drgears</a></p>
<p>It's a cockatrice, which seems dumb, but…well…</p>
<p>…</p>
<p>…ok, here it is. I was going to do something more urban myth-ish, but my daughter was watching My Little Pony while i was trying to work out the idea. The episode had a cockatrice in it, and i wondered &quot;why the hell do they do that? what's the point of turning things to stone, really? Wait, what if it's only the outside…just to keep prey still, then they chip inside and eat out all the soft bits…&quot;</p>
<p>So…yeah. Blame this one on my daughter and My Little Pony. That was hard to admit to…</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I am a little ashamed of myself, honestly&#8230;.</p>

